        "Title": "The Competition Subterfuge",
        "Location": "LOCATION_MIAMI",
        "PublicId": "111715740674",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/miami/scene_flamingo.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 32a178ff-7271-42bb-b266-4447614e229a).Image",
        "Description": "Your targets today are the Race Coordinators of the Miami Global Innovation Race: Kanye Belmonte and Ruperto Devine. Two high ranking officials of the race, recently found out to have been paid bribes to alter the results of the race.\r\rThe client also wishes for Kalvin Rutter, the race&apos;s organizer, to be eliminated, to ensure there is no suspicion from him or officials about the coordinator&apos;s deaths.\r\rAnd to ensure a cover up, they wish for the race to be... officially stopped in any matter.",
